WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.968
♪♪

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.400
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.834
After victories in Nevada

00:00:06.834 --> 00:00:08.467
and Arizona over the weekend,

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:09.834
Democrats are projected

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:11.501
to maintain control
of the Senate.

00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:14.067
But it's worth noting -- barely.

00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:15.634
Democrats are in control
of the Senate

00:00:15.634 --> 00:00:18.300
the way your grandma is
in control of her Chrysler.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.901
[ Laughter ]
Yeah,

00:00:19.901 --> 00:00:21.400
she has the steering wheel,

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.000
but I still don't feel
totally safe.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:26.667
Former President Trump
has announced

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:29.834
that he plans tomorrow to make
a "very big announcement."

00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:32.067
That's right --
He's very excited to announce

00:00:32.067 --> 00:00:35.000
that the 2024 election
has already

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.434
been stolen from him.

00:00:36.434 --> 00:00:38.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.467 --> 00:00:40.734
[ As Trump ] It's very unfair,
what the future holds.

00:00:40.734 --> 00:00:42.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:43.801
[ Normal voice ]
Yep, former President Trump

00:00:43.801 --> 00:00:46.367
is reportedly set to announce
his third run for president,

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:49.133
though, at this point,
the hats are becoming untenable.

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:52.634
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.634 --> 00:00:55.033
President Biden's 80th birthday
is this weekend.

00:00:55.033 --> 00:00:57.200
He'll celebrate it the same way
he does every year --

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.367
until 7:00 p.m.

00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:00.667
"All right, that's enough.

00:01:00.667 --> 00:01:02.534
Time for bed, folks."

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:04.334
According to a new poll,
voters would prefer

00:01:04.334 --> 00:01:05.868
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis

00:01:05.868 --> 00:01:08.434
to be the Republican
presidential nominee in 2024,

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:09.868
over former President Trump.

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:11.033
I can only assume it was

00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:13.033
because they weren't given
a third choice.

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:14.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.701 --> 00:01:17.234
Former President Trump's
daughter Tiffany got married

00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:18.968
on Saturday, and not,
as I thought,

00:01:18.968 --> 00:01:21.267
from the looks of that archway,
on Easter.

00:01:21.267 --> 00:01:22.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.934 --> 00:01:25.467
What'd you do at the reception,
hunt for eggs?

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:26.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.834 --> 00:01:28.567
Former President Trump gave
a toast over the weekend

00:01:28.567 --> 00:01:30.400
at his daughter Tiffany's
wedding and said,

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:32.133
"Have a great life together."

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:34.934
Well, that's very nice,
but after last week,

00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:37.033
we all know what a Trump
endorsement is worth.

00:01:37.033 --> 00:01:41.467
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:42.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.634 --> 00:01:44.200
Former President Trump attended

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.868
his daughter Tiffany's wedding
over the weekend

00:01:45.868 --> 00:01:47.934
and danced with her
to "Here Comes the Sun."

00:01:47.934 --> 00:01:50.167
Wow!
Usually in that family,

00:01:50.167 --> 00:01:52.133
"Here comes the son"
is a warning.

00:01:52.133 --> 00:01:55.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:55.667 --> 00:01:57.634
And, finally,
authorities in New York

00:01:57.634 --> 00:02:00.734
arrested a mother last month
after she allegedly allowed

00:02:00.734 --> 00:02:02.701
her 10-year-old son
to get a tattoo.

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:04.934
Worse, the tattoo was
to celebrate

00:02:04.934 --> 00:02:06.534
one year without a cigarette.

00:02:06.534 --> 00:02:09.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.567 --> 00:02:14.634
You'll think about it on the way
home and like it more.

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:16.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.667 --> 00:02:19.300
President Biden met in Bali
yesterday

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.634
with Chinese president
Xi Jinping.

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:26.033
It was the second most awkward
meeting of the week.

00:02:26.033 --> 00:02:28.167
[ As Trump ] And you say
you're a daughter of mine?

00:02:28.167 --> 00:02:30.534
That's great. Congratulations.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.534 --> 00:02:32.100
[ Normal voice ] President Biden
reportedly told

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:33.601
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi
last week

00:02:33.601 --> 00:02:35.234
that he hopes
she remains in office.

00:02:35.234 --> 00:02:38.734
He then waited 40 seconds
for her to say it back.

00:02:38.734 --> 00:02:40.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.901 --> 00:02:42.234
Arizona Secretary of State

00:02:42.234 --> 00:02:44.334
and Democratic gubernatorial
candidate Katie Hobbs

00:02:44.334 --> 00:02:47.000
is projected to defeat
Republican Kari Lake.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.567
Apparently, voters didn't think
Lake was a real Arizonan

00:02:49.567 --> 00:02:50.901
because nowhere in the state

00:02:50.901 --> 00:02:52.734
is it that foggy.

00:02:52.734 --> 00:02:54.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.734 --> 00:02:57.334
More than a year after his
apartment and office were raided

00:02:57.334 --> 00:02:59.901
by the FBI, federal prosecutors
announced yesterday

00:02:59.901 --> 00:03:02.968
that Rudy Giuliani will not face
criminal charges.

00:03:02.968 --> 00:03:05.133
And I'll bet he's relieved,
because he's really been

00:03:05.133 --> 00:03:07.667
sweating it
for the last 20 years.

00:03:07.667 --> 00:03:09.133
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.133 --> 00:03:11.767
Former Vice President Mike Pence
today released his memoir

00:03:11.767 --> 00:03:14.767
titled "So Help Me God,"
which is just what he says

00:03:14.767 --> 00:03:17.434
whenever he sees a woman
wearing slacks.

00:03:17.434 --> 00:03:20.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:23.934
ABC News aired an hour-long
sit-down interview last night

00:03:23.934 --> 00:03:25.601
with former Vice President
Mike Pence.

00:03:25.601 --> 00:03:27.100
So, if you've ever wondered

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.767
what an hour-long interview
with Mike Pence is like,

00:03:29.767 --> 00:03:31.934
watch a five-minute one.

00:03:31.934 --> 00:03:33.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.934 --> 00:03:37.601
The CDC last week named several
states in its worst category

00:03:37.601 --> 00:03:39.567
for flu levels, including
Alabama, Georgia,

00:03:39.567 --> 00:03:42.400
Mississippi, North Carolina,
Tennessee, and South Carolina.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:44.901
Basically, if your college
football team is any good,

00:03:44.901 --> 00:03:47.033
get your flu shot.

00:03:47.033 --> 00:03:48.133
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.133 --> 00:03:49.968
An Illinois couple
recently got married

00:03:49.968 --> 00:03:52.234
in the aisle
of an Aldi grocery store,

00:03:52.234 --> 00:03:54.767
and then they splurged
on the honeymoon.

00:03:54.767 --> 00:03:56.367
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.367 --> 00:03:57.734
♪♪

00:03:57.734 --> 00:03:59.634
Former president Trump
officially launched

00:03:59.634 --> 00:04:02.501
his 2024 presidential campaign
last night

00:04:02.501 --> 00:04:05.534
from the ballroom
of his Mar-a-Lago Club.

00:04:05.534 --> 00:04:08.634
Though it's hard to take a
campaign announcement seriously

00:04:08.634 --> 00:04:12.133
when you don't even
leave the house to do it.

00:04:12.133 --> 00:04:14.367
"I will lead America
to greatness again!

00:04:14.367 --> 00:04:16.667
All right, I think I'm gonna go
up and read for a while.

00:04:16.667 --> 00:04:18.667
Can you guys keep it down?"

00:04:18.667 --> 00:04:21.067
Former president Trump
officially announced last night

00:04:21.067 --> 00:04:23.300
that he will run for president
in 2024.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:25.667
I mean, okay,
but if you're gonna do it,

00:04:25.667 --> 00:04:28.133
we're going back
to the 2016 jokes.

00:04:28.133 --> 00:04:31.300
It's gonna be tiny hands,
bad hair stuff.

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:33.067
We're gonna mix it
with "Hamilton"

00:04:33.067 --> 00:04:35.067
and the lady Ghostbusters.

00:04:35.067 --> 00:04:36.634
The jokes are gonna be so hacky,

00:04:36.634 --> 00:04:38.467
you'll think Hillary
wrote the monologue.

00:04:38.467 --> 00:04:41.234
-Pokémon Go to the polls.

00:04:41.234 --> 00:04:43.033
-You'll wish
they were that good.

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:44.634
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:44.634 --> 00:04:47.400
When asked by a reporter
yesterday if he had any reaction

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:51.334
to former president Trump
announcing his 2024 campaign,

00:04:51.334 --> 00:04:53.701
President Biden said,
"Not really."

00:04:53.701 --> 00:04:56.167
Can't blame him.
It's still two years away.

00:04:56.167 --> 00:04:57.501
That's like someone asking you

00:04:57.501 --> 00:04:59.801
if you're excited
for "Avatar 3."

00:04:59.801 --> 00:05:01.601
I don't know, man.

00:05:01.601 --> 00:05:04.334
Gonna see how "2" looks,
I guess.

00:05:04.334 --> 00:05:05.901
During his speech last night,

00:05:05.901 --> 00:05:08.367
former president Trump bragged
about his close relationship

00:05:08.367 --> 00:05:10.234
with North Korean dictator
Kim Jong-un.

00:05:10.234 --> 00:05:12.801
Replied Kim Jong-un,
"No, no, no, don't endorse me.

00:05:12.801 --> 00:05:15.000
I...

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.634
saw what happened
in the midterms."

00:05:16.634 --> 00:05:19.767
NBC News has projected
that Republicans

00:05:19.767 --> 00:05:21.767
will take control of
the House of Representatives,

00:05:21.767 --> 00:05:24.267
thankfully,
this time the legal way.

00:05:24.267 --> 00:05:26.300
[ Light laughter ]

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:28.334
Former president Trump's
daughter Ivanka

00:05:28.334 --> 00:05:29.767
issued a statement last night

00:05:29.767 --> 00:05:31.200
that she will not
be participating

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.701
in his 2024 campaign.

00:05:32.701 --> 00:05:35.534
Said Jared, "Can you sign that
from both of us?"

00:05:35.534 --> 00:05:37.033
[ Laughter ]

00:05:37.033 --> 00:05:38.467
The makers of Coors Light

00:05:38.467 --> 00:05:40.901
yesterday launched
a color-changing nail polish

00:05:40.901 --> 00:05:43.501
that can be used
to help customers decide

00:05:43.501 --> 00:05:45.567
when their beer
is cold enough to drink.

00:05:45.567 --> 00:05:49.667
Or if you're out of nail polish,
try touching the can.

00:05:49.667 --> 00:05:51.601
[ Laughter ]

00:05:51.601 --> 00:05:54.267
Producers have released
the first trailer

00:05:54.267 --> 00:05:56.300
for the third
"Magic Mike" movie.

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:58.367
The news first --
[ Cheering ]

00:05:58.367 --> 00:06:01.033
[ Laughter ]

00:06:03.467 --> 00:06:05.501
The news first reported

00:06:05.501 --> 00:06:08.501
in a truly garbled text
from your mom.

00:06:08.501 --> 00:06:10.334
[ Laughter ]

00:06:13.934 --> 00:06:17.400
And finally, today was actor
Pete Davidson's 29th birthday.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:19.167
And if you're --
[ Cheering ]

00:06:19.167 --> 00:06:22.100
[ Laughter ]

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:24.634
Let me see if I can figure out
the connective tissue.

00:06:24.634 --> 00:06:26.000
Oh!

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:28.033
[ Laughter ]

00:06:29.634 --> 00:06:32.200
Today was actor Pete Davidson's
29th birthday.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.934
And if you're wondering what to
get him, nothing, he's fine.

00:06:34.934 --> 00:06:36.133
[ Laughter ]

00:06:36.133 --> 00:06:37.767
♪♪

00:06:37.767 --> 00:06:39.801
The White House
is reportedly planning

00:06:39.801 --> 00:06:41.334
to present President Biden

00:06:41.334 --> 00:06:44.601
with a birthday cake on Saturday
at his granddaughter's wedding.

00:06:44.601 --> 00:06:46.267
And if you're wondering
how old he is,

00:06:46.267 --> 00:06:49.133
he'll be at his
granddaughter's wedding.

00:06:49.133 --> 00:06:51.701
[ Laughter ]

00:06:51.701 --> 00:06:53.767
That's right, President Biden
will celebrate

00:06:53.767 --> 00:06:55.434
his 80th birthday on Sunday,

00:06:55.434 --> 00:06:58.601
while Fox News will celebrate it
all year long, baby!

00:06:58.601 --> 00:07:00.868
[ Laughter ]

00:07:00.868 --> 00:07:03.133
In a speech today
from the House floor,

00:07:03.133 --> 00:07:06.267
Speaker Nancy Pelosi announced
she will not seek another term

00:07:06.267 --> 00:07:07.534
as Democratic leader,

00:07:07.534 --> 00:07:10.033
but will remain in Congress
to finish her term.

00:07:10.033 --> 00:07:11.133
Meanwhile in the Senate,

00:07:11.133 --> 00:07:13.934
his eternal curse
remains unbroken.

00:07:13.934 --> 00:07:16.000
[ Laughter ]

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.501
The Senate yesterday
passed a bill

00:07:17.501 --> 00:07:20.601
to expand medical marijuana
research by unanimous consent.

00:07:20.601 --> 00:07:23.734
They also decided,
by an 85-15 vote,

00:07:23.734 --> 00:07:26.100
that "unanimous"
is a funny word.

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:28.968
[ Laughter ]

00:07:28.968 --> 00:07:31.667
[ Mouths words ]

00:07:34.434 --> 00:07:35.968
Former White House
Chief of Staff

00:07:35.968 --> 00:07:37.601
Mick Mulvaney
said in a new interview

00:07:37.601 --> 00:07:39.067
that he thinks
former President Trump

00:07:39.067 --> 00:07:43.434
is "the only Republican who
can lose in the 2024 election."

00:07:43.434 --> 00:07:45.701
"Hold my beer,"
said Herschel Walker

00:07:45.701 --> 00:07:46.734
to a mailbox.

00:07:46.734 --> 00:07:49.234
[ Laughter ]

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:54.567
During a campaign stop
yesterday in Georgia,

00:07:54.567 --> 00:07:56.334
Republican Senate candidate
Herschel Walker

00:07:56.334 --> 00:07:58.501
spent more than two minutes
trying to recount

00:07:58.501 --> 00:08:01.167
plot details from
an untitled vampire movie.

00:08:01.167 --> 00:08:03.868
Said Walker,
"Oh, it's not a movie."

00:08:03.868 --> 00:08:06.868
[ Laughter ]

00:08:09.267 --> 00:08:11.033
Tell him, mailbox.

00:08:11.033 --> 00:08:14.033
[ Laughter ]

00:08:14.033 --> 00:08:17.100
At the same stop, Republican
Senate candidate Herschel Walker

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:18.934
talked about werewolves
and vampires and said,

00:08:18.934 --> 00:08:20.834
"I don't want to be
a vampire anymore.

00:08:20.834 --> 00:08:22.234
I want to be a werewolf."

00:08:22.234 --> 00:08:23.434
Well, one thing's for certain --

00:08:23.434 --> 00:08:25.000
He definitely doesn't
want to be a senator.

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:27.467
[ Laughter ]

00:08:28.467 --> 00:08:30.534
Fans of the singer Morrissey
are upset

00:08:30.534 --> 00:08:33.167
after he recently
ended his concert abruptly

00:08:33.167 --> 00:08:34.934
after just 30 minutes
without any warning.

00:08:34.934 --> 00:08:37.467
Fortunately, if there's
one thing Morrissey fans love,

00:08:37.467 --> 00:08:39.767
it's when Morrissey
makes them upset.

00:08:39.767 --> 00:08:42.767
[ Laughter ]

00:08:44.501 --> 00:08:47.000
You know, I'm zinging a couple
of old high school girlfriends

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.000
with that one.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.234
[ Laughter ]

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:54.534
A man in Japan had
to remove a 90-inch jump rope --

00:08:54.534 --> 00:08:55.968
removed from his bladder

00:08:55.968 --> 00:08:59.367
after he shoved the rope
into his penis.

00:08:59.367 --> 00:09:03.767
On the bright side, he finally
got those kids off his lawn.

00:09:10.868 --> 00:09:14.467
Did we have to show the X-ray?

00:09:14.467 --> 00:09:17.300
A jump rope.

00:09:18.868 --> 00:09:22.033
Microsoft yesterday added
a collection of classic games

00:09:22.033 --> 00:09:24.868
to its Teams platform,
including solitaire.

00:09:24.868 --> 00:09:29.501
Yeah, 'cause what says "teams"
more than solitaire?

00:09:29.501 --> 00:09:31.400
The point is, you do it alone.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.567
Did you also add "Cranking It"?

00:09:33.567 --> 00:09:35.567
[ Laughter ]

00:09:40.767 --> 00:09:44.968
I mean, we're doing the -- We're
doing that jump-rope-penis bit.

00:09:46.234 --> 00:09:48.601
What's a good palate cleanser?

00:09:51.868 --> 00:09:55.701
Let's use an early '90s slang
for masturbation.

00:09:57.767 --> 00:10:01.267
That also reminds me of those
Morrissey fans.

00:10:01.267 --> 00:10:03.400
[ Laughter ]

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:06.133
A Florida scientist recently
found an entire alligator

00:10:06.133 --> 00:10:07.667
inside a Burmese python.

00:10:07.667 --> 00:10:10.067
It's what -- It is -- Oh [bleep]

00:10:10.067 --> 00:10:12.000
[ Laughter ]

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.667
This is -- And I feel bad
because this is

00:10:13.667 --> 00:10:15.367
maybe the tightest of
all the jokes.

00:10:15.367 --> 00:10:17.100
This is maybe
the most tightly written,

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:18.934
and that's why I'm gonna
take it back,

00:10:18.934 --> 00:10:21.434
because, you know,
credit where credit's due.

00:10:24.033 --> 00:10:26.133
Just try to think of anything
else to clear your mind.

00:10:26.133 --> 00:10:28.434
Maybe the jump-rope penis.

00:10:30.734 --> 00:10:33.634
A Florida scientist recently
found an entire alligator

00:10:33.634 --> 00:10:35.167
inside a Burmese python.

00:10:35.167 --> 00:10:39.434
It's what's called
a Florida turducken.

00:10:39.434 --> 00:10:41.367
Pretty good joke.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:41.367 --> 00:10:42.934
Pretty good joke.

00:10:46.067 --> 00:10:49.467
We couldn't get the X-ray
of what that would look like?

